{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage","id":1385589,"title":"How to play an elemental mage?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-04T05:15:22-07:00","id":1385589,"title":"How to play an elemental mage?","content":"I were wonderig if it's possible to make en elemental mage character. Something like a &quot;water mage&quot; or even a &quot;wind mage&quot;. Do you have any hint?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T05:34:30-07:00","id":1385592,"title":"","content":"Yes, forces for things like fire, wind or thunder, Matter for earth and water. Pick a Legacy for your chosen element.<br /> In 1ed you have the elemental legacies Tamers of... to use as example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T09:01:51-07:00","id":1385608,"title":"","content":"You can even just go Spirit just to make pacts with/enslave/summon elemental spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25423-voytek","name":"Voytek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25423_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T10:23:56-07:00","id":1385619,"title":"","content":"Like a &quot;wind mage&quot; with a wind spirit companion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T10:26:11-07:00","id":1385620,"title":"","content":"Yeah, though your &quot;wind mage&quot; will also be able to do an absurd amount of other things even if they just specialize in one Arcana. <br /> Familiar is a merit you can get so if you want to theme yourself and get an appropriate companion that'll be the way to do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25423-voytek","name":"Voytek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25423_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T14:17:21-07:00","id":1385651,"title":"","content":"I would recommend a 2ed version of the Storm Keepers:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-storm-keepers</a><br /> <br /> Perhaps the Tamers of Winds:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e/page3\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ed-to-2e/page3</a><br /> <br /> In elemental correspondences, Acanthus is the Path that represents wind. Either of those will give the extra Forces to manipulate its physical manifestation. <br /> <br /> As was mentioned, buying the Familiar merit may help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T15:55:31-07:00","id":1385958,"title":"","content":"It bears noting that a decent merit investment in a Shadow Name like &quot;Wind Master Nayin&quot; could go a decent way towards actually empowering wind spells without actually penalizing other spells. The neat thing is that, if your ST agrees, the Yantra bonus could apply to anything literally or metaphorically related to winds.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T16:28:03-07:00","id":1385969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thenate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage?p=1385958#post1385958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It bears noting that a decent merit investment in a Shadow Name like &quot;Wind Master Nayin&quot; could go a decent way towards actually empowering wind spells without actually penalizing other spells. The neat thing is that, if your ST agrees, the Yantra bonus could apply to anything literally or metaphorically related to winds.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Fart spells ahoy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T16:30:03-07:00","id":1385970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage#post1385589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I were wonderig if it's possible to make en elemental mage character. Something like a &amp;quot;water mage&amp;quot; or even a &amp;quot;wind mage&amp;quot;. Do you have any hint?</div> </div> </div> </div>First edition had 5 Elemental Tamer Legacies writes up. I believe they\u2019ve been updated for 2e by fans. Notably each does something in addition to raw elementalism, such as the Tamers of Wind use Forces for their raw air elemental attainments, and then Mind for the knowledge and clarity effects that symbolically relate to Air. While the Tamers of Rivers use Matter for the pure water elementalism Attainments, and then Life to act as healers. The Tamers of Stone use Space as mystic architects. Takers of Fire use Mind for raw emotional enflamement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T21:48:12-07:00","id":1386904,"title":"","content":"Also if I remembering correctly you can by Praxis that are a single spell your mage knows very well and focus it on the element they are seeking to control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T20:09:52-07:00","id":1387165,"title":"","content":"Tangential note:<br /> <br /> I've been thinking about elemental mages in Awakening for a little bit, and pecked at, but haven't finished, a rewriting of the arcana into a set of elemental aspects. (My favorite split is animate/inanimate aspects, so Water/Blood, Earth/Flesh&amp;bone, etc.)<br /> <br /> I was thinking along the lines of their paths being elemental revelations. An element like Fire would be the &quot;path&quot; of such a mage. <br /> <br /> It's a bit more ambitious a project than I think it's really worth, though, so I present the budget approach:<br /> <br /> Fire: Forces, Mind -Time<br /> Water: Life, Time -Forces<br /> Air: Fate, Spirit -Space<br /> Earth: Matter, Space -Fate<br /> Quintessence: Death, Prime -Matter<br /> <br /> (The shuffling is really needed because Forces, Matter, and Life really need to be split apart and dealt out to the proper elements. In doing that, a proper literal element thing could be meted out, as well. Without that, one might permit use the Nimbus as a literal manifestation..)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T16:47:11-07:00","id":1387835,"title":"","content":"If you wanted to leave the arcana as is there are already elemental associations with the Paths.<br /> <br /> Just as a possible example,<br /> <br /> Moros: Earth/Water <br /> Thyrsus: Wood<br /> Mastigos: Metal<br /> Obrimos: Fire<br /> Acanthus: Wind","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T17:38:25-07:00","id":1387841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage?p=1387835#post1387835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you wanted to leave the arcana as is there are already elemental associations with the Paths.<br /> <br /> Just as a possible example,<br /> <br /> Moros: Earth/Water<br /> Thyrsus: Wood<br /> Mastigos: Metal<br /> Obrimos: Fire<br /> Acanthus: Wind</div> </div> </div> </div>The established <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wuxing_(Chinese_philosophy)\" target=\"_blank\">Wuxing</a> elemental correspondences, at least, run as follows:<br /> <br /> Obrimos: Wood<br /> Mastigos: Fire<br /> Moros: Earth<br /> Acanthus: Metal<br /> Thyrsus: Water","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T19:54:51-07:00","id":1387873,"title":"","content":"Those are official Western Paths association of elements in book of Path and Tamers Legacies. <br /> <br /> Moros: Earth<br /> Thyrsus: Water<br /> Mastigos: Metal<br /> Obrimos: Fire<br /> Acanthus: Wind","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T20:12:18-07:00","id":1387875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage?p=1386904#post1386904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also if I remembering correctly you can by Praxis that are a single spell your mage knows very well and focus it on the element they are seeking to control.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is what I was thinking too. Praxes seem like a route towards legacies and a legacy should be an end goal of this kind of focus, if not something they already have. Surely people have homebrewed elemental legacies here, I know there's a pretty busy fan community.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T21:06:20-07:00","id":1387889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1385589-how-to-play-an-elemental-mage?p=1387873#post1387873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those are official Western Paths association of elements in book of Path and Tamers Legacies.<br /> <br /> Moros: Earth<br /> Thyrsus: Water<br /> Mastigos: Metal<br /> Obrimos: Fire<br /> Acanthus: Wind</div> </div> </div> </div>The Mastigos-based Elemental Tamers in Legacies: the Sublime is the Tamers of the Cave, whose element is Ether/the Void.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}